  "description": "Ariana, born into a politically arranged marriage, was nothing more than a tool, used and abused by her family her entire life. On her 28th birthday, she was tragically killed, yearning for a love that never came. Perhaps out of pity, a mysterious force sent her back to when she was 16. Reflecting on her painful past, she makes a vow:\n\n*\"I shall beg for love no longer. I will never love nor be loved again.\"*\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
